*signal* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''signal(signum, handlerFunc)''

Registers a signal handler function for the specified signal.

*Parameters:*
- ''signum'': Number signal number (see ''libsignals.chh'')
- ''handlerFunc'': Function to call when signal is received

*Returns:*
- ''ok'' on success

*Supported Signals:*
SIGHUP, SIGINT, SIGQUIT, SIGUSR1, SIGUSR2, SIGPIPE, SIGALRM, SIGTERM, SIGCHLD, SIGCONT, SIGTSTP, SIGTTIN, SIGTTOU, SIGURG, SIGWINCH

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if signum is not a number
- Runtime error if handlerFunc is not a function
- Runtime error if signal number is unsupported
